{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWrtxz4TAWWX26UiwFTo", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I built the connector faceplate and exported it to `submission.step`. It's a single valid solid, and reading the STEP file back gave the same size and volume as the part.\n\n**What I built:**\n- A thin plate 1.5 mm thick (X) by 160 mm long (Y) by 50 mm tall (Z), so it stands in the YZ plane.\n- A 56 × 21 mm rectangular window near the low-Y end.\n- Three narrow 1 × 6.5 mm slots just below the window.\n- One Ø3 mm hole near the high-Y end.\n\n**How it compares:** I rendered the part from the four camera positions you gave (`preview.png`), and the orientation and layout match `composite.png` in all four views. I estimated the sizes and positions by eye from the images, so they're approximate. The window in my part looks a little taller than in the target, but it's a small difference relative to the whole plate. Your voxel IoU score will show how close the final match is."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 739, "cache_read_input_tokens": 23383, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 739}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "c4793091-38a2-4c1b-b137-97fa83f3af36", "uuid": "c55d463b-e8bc-4fbb-a6c2-8e5769d3bd0d", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T16:41:28.990Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWrtxZ21Pmxc2hjsRsVt"}
